{"repositoryId":1349328247,"availability":"available","full":"AhmadHassan-BTed/Jantt","name":"Jantt","description":"The AI-native JSON Gantt chart engine. Dependency-free interactive timelines with React, script-tag, CLI, topological DAG solver, and formal JSON schema.","category":"Developer tools","language":"TypeScript","stars":264,"forks":1,"created":"2026-08-28T07:32:35Z","updated":"2026-10-09T17:35:40Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://ahmadhassan-bted.github.io/Jantt/","topics":["ai-tools","critical-path","dag","data-visualization","gantt","gantt-chart","json","json-schema","kanban","project-management","react","roadmap","timeline","typescript","zero-dependencies"],"demo":"https://ahmadhassan-bted.github.io/Jantt/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-15T13:02:05.956Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-15T13:02:05.956Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-15T13:02:05.956Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-15T13:02:05.956Z","stars":264,"forks":1}],"technologies":["React"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Where human intuition meets declarative AI planning.","Turn any declarative JSON document into a high-performance, interactive, draggable Gantt chart. Zero runtime dependencies. 100% pure TypeScript. Runs everywhere: Plain HTML, React, Next.js, Node.js CLI, and autonomous AI toolchains.","Live Playground • JSON Cheatsheet • Architecture • Schema Specification • API Docs • Roadmap • Changelog"],"features":["Autonomous AI Agents & LLMs — Declarative JSON schema contract eliminates UI hallucinations; models generate timeline data with 10x fewer tokens than fragile JSX code.","Students, Hobbyists & Creators — Lightweight, beautiful Swiss Noir dark mode, intuitive drag-and-drop, touch gestures, and instant local storage persistence.","Engineering Teams & Program Directors — Operations Research Critical Path solver, EVM (Earned Value Management), DCMA-14 schedule health audits, and multi-user CRDT collaboration with secure role-based permissions.","Enterprise Bloat: Commercial suites (DHTMLX, Bryntum) demand 200KB to 800KB runtime dependencies, complex imperative APIs (gantt.init(), gantt.addTask()), and expensive recurring per-seat fees.","Brittle AI Generations: Prompting LLMs (ChatGPT, Claude, Gemini) to generate React JSX or SVG coordinate math produces broken layouts, coordinate hallucinations, and wastes thousands of tokens on boilerplate UI code."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/AhmadHassan-BTed/Jantt/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"d67d9eee48a2f778b3d78b2b90e58281f88772cc403f27a1e59398305da8f36a","extractedAt":"2026-10-15T13:02:06.103Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-15T13:02:06.103Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Where human intuition meets declarative AI planning.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/AhmadHassan-BTed/Jantt/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Strict Single Provider: Google login and generic password forms are completely removed.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/AhmadHassan-BTed/Jantt/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Zero Manual Username Typing: Jantt automatically claims the user's verified GitHub handle (@username) directly into /usernames/{username} upon first sign-in.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/AhmadHassan-BTed/Jantt/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"d67d9eee48a2f778b3d78b2b90e58281f88772cc403f27a1e59398305da8f36a","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/AhmadHassan-BTed/Jantt/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-15T13:02:06.103Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-09T17:35:40Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/AhmadHassan-BTed/Jantt/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-15T13:02:06.104Z","hash":"d67d9eee48a2f778b3d78b2b90e58281f88772cc403f27a1e59398305da8f36a","originalBytes":35156,"storedBytes":35156,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["jantt","json","schema","end","core","color","start","tas